    "finalName": "",
    "description": "As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Full-Round_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Full-Round Action\">Full-Round Action</a>, you can beguile one or more targets of your choice within 6 squares and line of sight, making a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a> check against their <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a>. If successful, the targets suffer a -5 penalty to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> checks for one round. You can keep the targets captivated as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Full-Round_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Full-Round Action\">Full-Round Action</a> each subsequent round, making a new <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a> check each time. The effect immediately ends if the targets are attacked or threatened.",
